# --- Robot password store: never commit plaintext or private keys ---------------------------------
# The ENCRYPTED store (secrets/robot_passwords.age) and the PUBLIC recipient
# (secrets/recipient.txt) are meant to be committed. Everything below is the
# stuff that must never reach git: the shared private key and any decrypted
# copy of the store.
secrets/*.key
secrets/*.agekey
secrets/*age-secret*
secrets/identity*
*.age-identity
# Any plaintext / decrypted dump of the store.
secrets/*.plain.json
secrets/*.plaintext
secrets/*decrypted*

# Temporary one-off bootstrap that re-introduces cookie scraping to seed the store; delete after use.
password_collector.py